B.ePx=new A.y("Frame","You have 12 pairs of ribs. They make a cage that protects your heart and lungs and moves when you breathe.")
B.f5l=new A.y("Frame","The sternum is a flat bone in the middle of your chest that holds your ribs together at the front.")
B.eQn=new A.y("Frame","The most often broken bone, and the only long bone that lies sideways.")
B.eJI=new A.y("Frame","Two flat triangle bones on your back that let your arms swing in a big circle.")
